# Rule Improvement

Self-improvement system for cursor rules - monitors codebase patterns and suggests rule improvements.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Patterns appear in codebase
- Repeated implementations detected
- Common errors occur
- Best practices emerge
- Documentation gaps found
- Rules need improvement

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - Stable improvement patterns.

